    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d687">

                <pb facs="0810" n="718" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg718"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.85/572</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McMillin</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lima</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-07T22:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 7, 1918, 10 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 10.42 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The contract between the Shipping Board and the Peruvian Government concerning
                    interned German ships was approved by Peruvian Congress September 5, signed the
                    6th, and on same night Gardner departed with two of
                    them.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">McMillin</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
